{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROGOLF is an upcoming rogue-lite, where you play mini-golf, buy equipment and get points based on your collected coins &amp; remaining shots. You'll have to have enough cumulated points to go through each Gates, and reach the top !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is different and each levels have its own rules ! You'll have to trade your tees for items that will change the course of your run !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Mini Golf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ROGOLF, each shot costs you points, and each coin collected increases your multiplier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/3c63ae481966fe290849cdbf5be02bb4.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/3c63ae481966fe290849cdbf5be02bb4.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/3c63ae481966fe290849cdbf5be02bb4.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve higher and higher scores, you'll need to purchase power-ups that will allow you to lose as few points as possible and increase your multiplier ever higher!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/955e4d89ab3826753d40f5133956de8c.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/955e4d89ab3826753d40f5133956de8c.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/955e4d89ab3826753d40f5133956de8c.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate enough points on each level to move from stage to stage, at each Gate, and reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810020?t=1765207902","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810020?t=1765207902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/eb2c2edb9bbd4902eabe8b0c4b6fa73f9665f6f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765207902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/eb2c2edb9bbd4902eabe8b0c4b6fa73f9665f6f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765207902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3822070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROGOLF is an upcoming rogue-lite, where you play mini-golf, buy equipment and get points based on your collected coins &amp; remaining shots. You'll have to have enough cumulated points to go through each Gates, and reach the top !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is different and each levels have its own rules ! You'll have to trade your tees for items that will change the course of your run !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/8fa65b85aa0829e75c1fa2ddb743b277.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Mini Golf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/c04d8dd864061424b08d686502c36054.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ROGOLF, each shot costs you points, and each coin collected increases your multiplier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/3c63ae481966fe290849cdbf5be02bb4.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/3c63ae481966fe290849cdbf5be02bb4.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/3c63ae481966fe290849cdbf5be02bb4.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve higher and higher scores, you'll need to purchase power-ups that will allow you to lose as few points as possible and increase your multiplier ever higher!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the Top</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/955e4d89ab3826753d40f5133956de8c.poster.avif?t=1765207902\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/955e4d89ab3826753d40f5133956de8c.webm?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/extras/955e4d89ab3826753d40f5133956de8c.mp4?t=1765207902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate enough points on each level to move from stage to stage, at each Gate, and reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Seabird Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810020/d5af69ebe0b4f1812d7708183616643e3bc81af7/header.jpg?t=1765207902","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6gb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1, intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 7 cores GPU, Intel Iris Plus Graphics 640<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<st